        "text": "**Bell-to-Bus Sprint**\n\nFinal bell rings. Alex has 4 minutes to grab gear, check if practice moved to the gym, and mark “I’m coming.” Phone shows 12% battery; one hand is full of cleats.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d5bd3397d0cc93828262d79ba5f2028a-alexPanel1.png",
