      },
      {
        "text": "**Weight Room Wi-Fi Blackout**\n\nIn the weight room, the app won’t load. Alex screenshots the workout, does sets, and plans to log later on the bus.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0f3f02720d69446225ac04f58aebe502-alexPanel2.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson7-level1a-test-2025-c3339823-e575-4ce3-82be-19069a378715",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Post-Game, Post-Homework Eyes**\n\nIt’s 9:30pm. Alex is exhausted, icing a knee, and wants to skim tomorrow’s plan and jot a quick recovery note without bright screens or tiny text.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ed7c3c31436c42b77ec68b3587fc87b3-alexPanel3.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson7-level1a-test-2025-2ce33a5f-e118-4d4b-bc41-178b6be2125a",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Coach & Parent Check-Ins**\n\nCoach asks “Status for Friday?” Parent needs pickup timing. Alex wants to share a simple “Available / Limited / Out” without exposing private journal notes.",
